# Trust Code Over Docs

Ensures code is verified when documentation is referenced. Trust actual implementation over documentation.

## When to Apply

Apply this rule when:
- Referencing documentation
- Working with APIs, libraries, or frameworks
- Documentation claims need verification
- Code and documentation might differ

